abstract: >
  HERESY v4.0.0 is a dependency-free offline architecture-budget simulator.
  Users apply seven engineering choices to a small or custom product brief and
  receive deterministic estimates for payload, dependencies, latency, cloud
  cost, risk, meetings, delivery time, user value, resume value and bloat. A
  real COBOL DATA DIVISION supplies all 28 scoring rules and defines the
  379-character fixed-record database. Checksummed run records can be listed,
  inspected, deleted, imported and exported without JSON, SQL, IndexedDB, an
  ORM, a build step or a network request. The complete production application
  is limited to 131,072 bytes.
